<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18147" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fī^glīnus</span></b> , or,
		in the uncontr. primary form, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fĭgŭlīnus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		1. figulus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a
			potter</i>, <i>potter</i>'<i>s</i>-
			(cf. fictilis). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Form
			figlinus: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">creta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 3, 9, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">opera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					35, 10, 36, § 66</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Subst.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">figlīna</span></b> ,
			ae, f.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>a.</b>
			<i>The art</i> or <i>trade of a
			potter</i> (sc. ars), <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 1, 2, 23</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>A potter</i>'<i>s workshop</i>, <i>pottery</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 6,
				12, § 82</span></i>; <i><span class="en">35, 12, 46, §
			159</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 1, p. 371
			sq.</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in the form FIGVLINA,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell. 935</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">figlīnum</span></b> ,
			i, n., <i>an earthen
			vessel</i>, <i>crock</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 31, 3,
				27, § 46</span></i>; <i><span class="en">34, 18, 50, §
			170</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">opus figulinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					36, 25, 64, § 189</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fabricae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 7,
					56, 57, § 198</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vitr.
				5</span></i>,  10, 3.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Form figulinus: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">opus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					31, 11, 47, § 130</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fornaces,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 6, 200</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
